/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-08-16T22:25:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T11:27:08Z","closed_at":"2025-10-07T11:27:08Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n* Reproducible in 4.5-dev2 and later (up to 4.5-beta5).\n* Not reproducible in 4.4.1 and 4.5-dev1.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - macOS Sequoia (15.6.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 Pro (Apple8) - Apple M2 Pro (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSince 4.5-dev2, Godot will not launch in the current MacOS active desktop if any other desktop includes an open Finder window: the active desktop will automatically change to the one containing the last open Finder window and Godot's project manager window will launch behind that Finder window.\n\nIf multiple desktops include a Finder window, the last one to have been opened is targeted.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis screen recording shows the steps used to reproduce the behavior consistently:\n\n* Initial desktop is 1 (desktop number is displayed as a number in the system's top right menubar for convenience), no Finder window is open.\n* Moving to desktop 2 and launching Godot results in the expected behavior: Godot opens in desktop 2.\n* Going back to desktop 1 and creating a Finder window, and later moving to desktop 2 to launch Godot shows the problematic behavior: desktop is automatically switched to 1 and Godot's project manager launches behind the Finder window.\n* After closing the FInder window in desktop 1 and going back to desktop 2, Godot launches in 2 again as expected.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/381d14ae-d9a5-4a03-a98f-44fda757e10d\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot needed, impacts project manager.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id